{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A physics 2D action game where you guide a snake with your mouse and climb a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;While clicking, the snake moves in the direction of the mouse cursor&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's all there is to it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is not much that the player can do, so there is no need to memorize the controls and rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/\u30e1\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2_\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30e4\u30fc_2024_10_05_15_07_51.png?t=1735231787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the snake's behavior is unique and it is difficult to manipulate it as expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various gimmicks await you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/\u30e1\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2_\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30e4\u30fc_2024_10_18_18_25_24.png?t=1735231787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a collection element and a story element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you climb, the reason for aiming for the top is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191770?t=1735231787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3191770?t=1735231787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/616c7d5804994ecf492db34a10efd724cfcafc03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735231787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/616c7d5804994ecf492db34a10efd724cfcafc03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735231787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3276790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A physics 2D action game where you guide a snake with your mouse and climb a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;While clicking, the snake moves in the direction of the mouse cursor&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's all there is to it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is not much that the player can do, so there is no need to memorize the controls and rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/\u30e1\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2_\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30e4\u30fc_2024_10_05_15_07_51.png?t=1735231787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, the snake's behavior is unique and it is difficult to manipulate it as expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various gimmicks await you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/extras/\u30e1\u30c7\u30a3\u30a2_\u30d7\u30ec\u30fc\u30e4\u30fc_2024_10_18_18_25_24.png?t=1735231787\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is a collection element and a story element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you climb, the reason for aiming for the top is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Utayo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191770/header.jpg?t=1735231787","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257077945,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077945/movie480.mp4?t=1733020650","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257077945/movie_max.mp4?t=1733020650"},"name":"pv2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257077945/e18b849dd7701f779e163742ef519f6e11